## ghostless

Local voice project. The corpus, transcripts, and gold edits stay on this machine.

| User intent | Skill |
| --- | --- |
| Draft something that sounds like me | `ghostless-draft` |
| Tighten or cut a draft I wrote | `ghostless-edit` |
| I finished a piece; learn from my edits | `ghostless-learn` |

- Read `voice-guide.md` in the project (`ghostless locate`). Run `ghostless build` if it is missing.
- After a draft, run `ghostless judge`.
- Leave `[WRITER: your take]` where an opinion, quote, statistic, or anecdote is needed. Do not invent those.
- When the user says a piece is finished and both drafts exist, run `ghostless learn`, then `ghostless build`.
